<div class="pulse-fd" id="tape-chart" data-ajax="{$ajax_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}" data-walkin="{$walkin_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}" data-folio="{$folio_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}" data-start="{$start}" data-days="{$days}">
<div class="panel"><h3><i class="icon-calendar"></i> Tape Chart
  <span class="pull-right form-inline"><button class="btn btn-default btn-sm" id="tc-prev">&laquo;</button> <input type="date" id="tc-start" class="form-control input-sm" value="{$start}"> <select id="tc-days" class="form-control input-sm"><option value="7" {if $days==7}selected{/if}>7 days</option><option value="14" {if $days==14}selected{/if}>14 days</option><option value="21" {if $days==21}selected{/if}>21 days</option><option value="31" {if $days==31}selected{/if}>31 days</option></select> <button class="btn btn-default btn-sm" id="tc-next">&raquo;</button> <button class="btn btn-default btn-sm" id="tc-today">Today</button></span></h3>
  <p class="help-block">Drag a stay to another room or date &middot; drag its right edge to extend/shorten &middot; click an empty cell to start a reservation &middot; click a stay for details. Hatched = OOO/OOS, dotted outline = group block allotment not yet picked up.</p>
  <div id="tc-wrap"><table id="tc-table" class="tc"><thead></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div>
</div>
<div class="modal fade" id="tc-diff"><div class="modal-dialog modal-sm"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><h4>Room type change</h4></div><div class="modal-body"><p>Target room is a different category. Differential per night to post (0 = complimentary):</p><input id="tc-diff-amt" class="form-control" type="number" step="0.01" value="0"></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">Cancel</button><button class="btn btn-primary" id="tc-diff-ok">Move</button></div></div></div></div>
</div>
